WEBVTT

00:00:27.836 --> 00:00:31.516
but try to project a longer arc,
a broader context.

00:00:31.516 --> 00:00:34.676
Our guest is geopolitical
analyst Ian Bremmer.

00:00:34.676 --> 00:00:36.956
He's the founder
and president of Eurasia Group,

00:00:36.956 --> 00:00:38.716
